  "title": "Praseodymium alkoxide chemistry: synthesis and molecular structure of [Pr4(μ4-O)2(μ3,η2-OR)2(μ,η2-OR)4(μ,η1-OR)(OR)(OPMe3)]2 (R = C2H4OMe) and [Y4Pr(μ5-O)(μ3-OR)4(μ-OR)4(OR)5] (R = Pri)",
