        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under argon, a toluene:PriOH (1:1) solution (250 cm3) was added to praseodymium chips (12.05 g, 85.5 mmol). After refluxing for 1 h, 10 mg of catalyst [HgCl2:Hg(OAc)2, 1:1] were added and refluxing was maintained for 48 h. The hot mixture was filtered over Celite, the filtrate cooled to −35 °C, and yellow-green crystals of Pr5O(OPri)13 (1) were isolated by filtration and dried in vacuo (24.4 g, 90%).",
